flowchart TD
    Start([User Navigates to Planet Explorer]) --> LoadData[Load Planetary Dataset via SpaceDataProvider]
    LoadData --> CheckWebGL{WebGL 3D Context Available?}
    
    CheckWebGL -- Yes --> InitThree[Initialize Three.js WebGL Spherical Viewport]
    CheckWebGL -- No --> Init2D[Initialize 2D HTML5 Canvas Fallback Viewport]
    
    InitThree --> RenderPlanet[Render Procedural Surface Texture, Tilt & Solar Lighting]
    Init2D --> RenderPlanet
    
    RenderPlanet --> UserAction{User Interaction}
    
    UserAction -- Rotate/Zoom --> UpdateCamera[Update Viewport Rotation / Orbit Controls]
    UpdateCamera --> RenderPlanet
    
    UserAction -- Switch Planet --> SelectPlanet[Select Target from Navigator Array]
    SelectPlanet --> UpdateStore[Update Zustand selectedPlanetId]
    UpdateStore --> RenderPlanet
    
    UserAction -- Calculate Weight --> WeightSim[Enter Earth Weight in Simulator]
    WeightSim --> ComputeWeight["Compute W = W_earth * (g_planet / 9.81)"]
    ComputeWeight --> DisplayWeight[Display Relative Weight and Gravity Ratio]
    
    UserAction -- Launch Comparison --> SelectSecond[Select Second Comparison Planet]
    SelectSecond --> ComputeRatios[Calculate Diameter, Mass & Orbital Ratios]
    ComputeRatios --> DisplayInsights[Generate Deterministic Scientific Comparison Insights]
    
    UserAction -- Save Favorite --> ToggleBookmark[Click Star Bookmark Button]
    ToggleBookmark --> SaveVault[Persist FavoriteItem to localStorage Vault]
    SaveVault --> LogEvent[Log planet_viewed Telemetry Event]
    
    DisplayWeight --> UserAction
    DisplayInsights --> UserAction
    LogEvent --> UserAction
    
    UserAction -- Exit Module --> Finish([User Navigates Away])

